WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
You have 9 grapes and eat 4.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:03.820
How many are left?

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.900
Take 4 away, one at a time.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.800
Count what remains: 5.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.420
So 9 take away 4 is 5.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:14.016
Check: 5 and 4 make 9 again.
